      <pubDate>Mon, 08 Jun 2026 02:01:04 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/7/2/1/72137ab5f9e78b25d2dbb9e6a01895fda2081390.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/ghaahO6qI67OkJmWR0eusnlLMIM.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/7/2/1/72137ab5f9e78b25d2dbb9e6a01895fda2081390.png&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;ghaahO6qI67OkJmWR0eusnlLMIM&quot; width=&quot;477&quot; height=&quot;500&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;171718&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;
找到了一种可以免费获得 Kiro Dev Pro 的方法。&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;zh&quot;&gt;步骤如下：&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;zh&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn.ldstatic.com/images/emoji/twemoji/one.png?v=15&quot; title=&quot;:one:&quot; class=&quot;emoji&quot; alt=&quot;:one:&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot;&gt; 使用全新的电子邮件地址注册。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;zh&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn.ldstatic.com/images/emoji/twemoji/two.png?v=15&quot; title=&quot;:two:&quot; class=&quot;emoji&quot; alt=&quot;:two:&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot;&gt; 前往“专业订阅”页面。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;zh&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn.ldstatic.com/images/emoji/twemoji/three.png?v=15&quot; title=&quot;:three:&quot; class=&quot;emoji&quot; alt=&quot;:three:&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot;&gt; 价格将自动显示为 0.00 美元。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;zh&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn.ldstatic.com/images/emoji/twemoji/four.png?v=15&quot; title=&quot;:four:&quot; class=&quot;emoji&quot; alt=&quot;:four:&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot;&gt; 立即取消以避免日后产生费用。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
